                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kandi niba ari umukene ntabashe kubona umwana w'intama, azazane intungura ebyiri cyangwa ibyana by'inuma bibiri, kimwe cy'igitambo cyo koswa, ikindi cyo gutambirwa ibyaha, umutambyi amuhongerere abe ahumanutse.”",
          "type": "text",
